    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The world is still a mess\u2026\n\nAt least now we can laugh about it \ud83d\ude05\n\nJoy in the Trenches\nNow streaming on Netflix\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2044053066131911113",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T14:00:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "In America: \u201cYou\u2019ll get paid later.\u201d\nPeople: shows up to work\n\nIn South Africa:\n\u201cI\u2019ll see you when the money does.\u201d\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2043879664951632183",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T02:31:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s almost time.\n\nMy New Special, April 14 only on Netflix.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2043766167664505263",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T19:00:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I'm back. New special \u2014 April 14. \nOnly on Netflix.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2043358480619471341",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T16:00:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Chris Rock really told me I\u2019d be the \"worst comedian ever\"\n\n\"Comedy comes from life. You ain't living\".\n\nHe's right! You can\u2019t make comedy just by doing it; you have to go out and live.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2043060517301031125",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T20:16:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "How do you control countries\u2026\nwhen they can just say \u201cno\u201d?\nThat\u2019s the part nobody talks about.\n\nCatch the full episode on YouTube and join the conversation.\n\n#Politics #UN #Geopolitics #WhatNow\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2042787216452186517",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T02:10:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s coming\u2026 new special, new jokes.\n\nJoy in the Trenches\nApril 14. Only on Netflix.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2042679013366460777",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T19:00:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Boomers built wealth.\nMillennials built coping mechanisms.\nAnd somehow\u2026 it\u2019s the coffee\u2019s fault.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2042336999932346464",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T20:21:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Joy in the Trenches\nApril 14 on Netflix\n\n@netflix @NetflixIsAJoke @strongblacklead\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2041908929215787316",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T16:00:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When people are hurting, they look for answers.\n\nThe problem is\u2026\nsome answers are easier than the truth.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2041619773885444363",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T20:51:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
